{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The ultimate chapter is here!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're thrilled to present CHAINS OF DEPRAVITY, the climactic final expansion that completes Eleanor in Miami. This isn't just an update - it's the unforgettable farewell to Eleanor's journey, plunging deeper into her most uninhibited, hedonistic desires. Prepare for intense new content packed with humiliation, indulgence, submission, and raw, boundary-pushing passion - exactly what Eleanor has craved... and what you've been waiting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/b5b4d747ac782b3869b0d1be01b08b09.avif?t=1771753824\" width=981 height=433 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive New Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kneel before Mr. Banks, Drake's most demanding client, to seal the deal with total obedience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Senka's revenge - under her commanding supervision as a ruthless female pimp, service every man in the club... right in the public restroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the darkest paths in an expanded Theodore's dungeon ending, featuring the twisted Monsieur DuBois and his gimp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 4 brand-new sex scenes with Bogdan (VIP casino room &amp; park) and Senka (photo studio &amp; beach).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/ea385f7016610dda4ada515f8c28e005.poster.avif?t=1771753824\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/ea385f7016610dda4ada515f8c28e005.webm?t=1771753824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/ea385f7016610dda4ada515f8c28e005.mp4?t=1771753824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Game-Wide Overhaul</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're not stopping at new content. The entire game, base version + all previous expansions, is getting a stunning visual upgrade powered by our latest rendering tech (surpassing even French Confessions):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced static images</strong> - Every scene rebuilt with 50% more detail: ultra-realistic skin textures, advanced lighting, lifelike hair, and premium materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Re-rendered animations</strong> - All sequences reconstructed from scratch for unmatched smoothness and realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully animated finales</strong> - The most explosive climaxes (facial, breast, body) now come alive with breathtaking animation. Every ending feels epic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/8998d2bda0fd739bf8fa091d0aa33965.avif?t=1771753824\" width=1000 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor felt the suffocating weight of her past pressed down on her shoulders, and she sank further into her chair as she begged Drake to leave this place to start fresh in Florida. When she told him about Kevin and how he had been using her for months, Drake's expression shifted from shock to profound sadness. His hands trembled as he thought about possibly breaking up their marriage. But in the end, Drake couldn't bear the idea of not having Eleanor, and he chose to forgive her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor's addiction to the thrill of meaningless sex had pushed her husband, Drake, to a breaking point. In a desperate attempt to save their marriage, they agreed to a rather unconventional solution - Eleanor would be allowed to sleep with other people if it was in the presence of her husband. The same rule was designed for Drake. For Eleanor, this seemed like the perfect compromise; she would get the thrill of illicit sex without actually cheating on her husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They moved into a small apartment and began their next step together. Eleanor promised Drake she would stay faithful, yet she still fought with temptation daily and wondered what dirty secret she could keep hidden if he weren't watching closely. She got a job at Faith's beauty salon, where she formed tight bonds with other girls without any of them knowing each other's stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/595f347145aa1da531312a6040282f5f.poster.avif?t=1771753824\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/595f347145aa1da531312a6040282f5f.webm?t=1771753824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283200/extras/595f347145aa1da531312a6040282f5f.mp4?t=1771753824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine-translated languages added - check if your preferred language is supported for a more immersive experience in your native tongue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese simplified</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polish</p></l